OL,3,GNEWSAStinky 'skunk' plant cleared from
OL,4,Ariver
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn invasive plant said to smell like
OL,7,F"rotting meat" has been cleared from a
OL,8,FBuckinghamshire river.
OL,10,FMore than 2.5km (1.6 miles) of the
OL,11,FRiver Alderbourne has been treated for
OL,12,FAmerican skunk cabbage, which is native
OL,13,Fto swamps and other wetlands in the
OL,14,FPacific Northwest.
OL,16,FBBC Gardeners' World Magazine has
OL,17,Fdescribed the plant as having a smell
OL,18,Fthat resembles "rotting meat".
OL,20,FEnvironmental charity Groundwork South
OL,21,Freceived #9,900 from Affinity Water's
OL,22,FINNS Out Scheme to carry out the work.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
